{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "c76053e2dfe398d27502510132c690bb318bdef947c8cfa02ba68c19afcfa03d", "ja": "ウッキーウッキー☆地方公演", "zh": "吱吱叫☆地方公演", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a06c79bebc3624ceb0e151cfca8bab9a03f5ee93c230509f9b1b94b743897151", "ja": "デュオを組んで地方公演を行うことになった\n真美と環。ふたりは親交を深めるため、プロ\nデューサーも引き連れて劇場を探検すること\nに。さっそく倉庫のドアを開けてみると、そ\nこはジャングルだった。", "zh": "真美跟环将组成双人组举行地方公演。\n两人为了增进彼此的情谊，\n决定带着制作人一起在剧场里探险。\n结果一打开仓库门，眼前竟是一片丛林。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "15e0fd70ddd936a82131f357233a8539a84be14bf2834f802a86feef2be4f599", "ja": "（思ったより仕事の電話が長引いてしまった。\n早く真美達とのミーティングに行かないと！）", "zh": "（结果工作电话讲得比我预计的还要久。\n得快点去跟真美她们开会才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "d4a6bd6b7493bb94eb255560e6cf788aa7afd5c97ef32fae6c1eaed076d6f9d9", "ja": "そのボスは普通に戦っても倒せないよ、たまきち！\nそいつ幽霊だから、まずは塩を投げなきゃ！", "zh": "这个头目用一般的方式是打不赢的喔，阿环！\n因为它是幽灵，得先撒盐巴才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "79f4d07e7c7699306bfb29ca9ac6952e5afe883a2620113d1bc316ccb31c9e89", "ja": "そっか！　ボスめ、くらえーっ！　てーいっ！\n……やった、倒せたぞー♪　たまきレッドの勝ち！", "zh": "原来如此！可恶的头目，吃环这招！嘿──！\n……太棒了，打倒啰♪红色战士环赢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1003_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2b56d0423d5bfad8998b7dc71b5d7a3baeba64b3f0f897250042ce84a305b714", "ja": "待たせちゃったな。ゴメン。\n……うん？　環がゲームしてるの、珍しいな。", "zh": "让你们久等了，抱歉。\n……嗯？环会打电动还真稀奇呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "acd72c284db896653fc5b77dd23f4d84c1c94c92825344f7fdbe3bea6c5c2704", "ja": "まみが貸してくれたの！　たまき、リーダーのレッド\nだぞ！　くふふ、ゲームってけっこう面白いね♪", "zh": "是真美借环的！环是红色战士队长喔！\n呵呵，电动还真有趣耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "ff6bb83254e5b7f523e16e459ec51af84217787b0481a6da30ccb68f6116d52e", "ja": "うんうん、たまきちはゲーマーの才能がありますな～。\nじゃあ、次のボスを倒しに行こー！", "zh": "嗯嗯，阿环很有当游戏玩家的天分呢～\n那么来去打倒下一个头目吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "feb46c5cc04754df9ce640df925a562b30c80b8c48b0a557f1666ea37c73c829", "ja": "こらこら。ゲームはその辺にして、\nミーティングを始めるぞ。", "zh": "喂喂，电动先玩到这里，\n要开始开会啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "71a4b3209dd58109362799737707bed97a4d1589ae5f55d3adfbaba98ee88bd3", "ja": "ええっ、これからがイイトコなのに！？\nそんな律っちゃんみたいなコト言わないでよ～。", "zh": "咦咦？好戏才要开始的说！\n你讲话不要这么像小律嘛～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "00742765ea6700ac0326e1882d1eaa964848a24c042b7bfeebd76a7e3096163d", "ja": "……いっとくけど、律子がよく厳しいことを言うのは、\n真美のためを思ってのことだからな？", "zh": "……我先提醒一下，律子之所以说话严格，\n也都是为了真美着想喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "57c4ac6c885128b99c3533d736cc6c6b035bfc294d1bbc85cae31cd1a3c46bac", "ja": "わかってるってば～。真美はただ、\n甘やかしてほしいだけに決まってるっしょ？", "zh": "这些真美其实都懂啦～\n只是想要被宠爱而已，这不是当然的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "933304b25c0799f517df9fc2078d0458fd91abebdfb01ce71e0f5701ba2be77f", "ja": "そ、そうか。決まってたのか……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。是当然的吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "28353084bc2105b4f1e517fbfdd35edb6160a200ed1bf52f2e5fc2b0f0e21252", "ja": "おやぶん、たまき達にだいじな話があるって\n言ってたけど、何？", "zh": "老大，你说有重要的事要找环我们，\n是什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cbaa48f080fe04a2d422fe945200ce89343134cf5b998c4a94dc03ae07f3b633", "ja": "ああ。実は、環と真美には、\nデュオを組んでもらおうと思ってる。", "zh": "嗯。\n其实我想让环跟真美组成双人组。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "70f6f1f6447690bce189238fca813af8c497a00c1caa555fad09d3eab8fac6b6", "ja": "え！　真美とたまきちで！？", "zh": "咦！真美跟阿环两个人吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "5be48642feaaa5f06ed5900b9bc03ee54ae99d3ce8756dd7186207d0c10af579", "ja": "……おやぶん、デュオって、なーに？", "zh": "……老大，双人组是什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c04d1e7b95bb71b6e30ec32992a5cff5e325cc73ae0bc34fd324b0a4751a5451", "ja": "二人組のユニットってことだ。そして、ふたりの\nお披露目ライブは、地方で行おうと考えてるんだ。", "zh": "就是两个人组成的团体。\n还有，预计会在其他县市举办你们的首次亮相演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "9ec98fd92e004d39a1081e244eb80e37c4d584c25826b97f21f0ce819d25fc72", "ja": "なにそれ、メッチャ面白そー！\nゲームやめて正解だったね、たまきち！", "zh": "怎么会这样，感觉超有趣的～！\n没有继续打电动是正确的耶，阿环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "9e8d0840c502c783721a55de6fcda2a9fbc7d0c227434380fdfee4042fc915ca", "ja": "うん！　たまきもデュオ、やってみたい！", "zh": "嗯！环也想挑战看看双人组！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "71c361893543c47bb02e7c6004180fa938cb96d66241c79cf15f9293cf1e0122", "ja": "それはよかった。\nそして、ふたりに歌ってもらう曲はこれだ！", "zh": "那就太好了。\n然后要请你们唱的是这首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "220eb1101fc457bcab584334c88c4af0c8d4a97e8c2739a664927c0e8fb78f40", "ja": "おーっ！　たまき、なんかワクワクしてきた！\nまみといっしょに歌うの、すっごく楽しみだぞ！", "zh": "哦～！环感觉开始兴奋起来了！\n好期待跟真美一起唱歌喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "c6a8f6c44e1f394c1eace8fe33e9120677749736154a6bd0b179a2672c417293", "ja": "うんうん、ライブもメッチャ盛り上がりそうだよね♪", "zh": "嗯嗯，演唱会感觉也会超嗨的耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "ee750271ff3b4a92bd4691062b1f41d79a9c9dbf519ec9c636a83d7749233695", "ja": "ウンババー！", "zh": "嗯吧吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "2f72f46aa48f36dacbd93b590e5f9bae9d6b356ef7618440e182e5fc68cfd0fd", "ja": "ズンドコズンドコ！", "zh": "咚隆锵咚隆锵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "51cbb30c5932e905a1172de44906059a0a021cfff6bac9da46a4b0ae5a4a4159", "ja": "ははは、ふたり共、気に入ってくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "哈哈哈，看来你们都很喜欢这首曲子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1026_se", "source_sha256": "8b642a4d64f467aabb10b3f1e9e48707241d527e80c84c87f10c2ea71c0246dc", "ja": "ゴゴゴゴゴ……。", "zh": "轰隆隆隆隆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "578568b4afc5a3f723aa6202aa414e74ef98146c7b4339e9d93d94698a95d093", "ja": "（おっと……、なんだ？\n今、何か……？）", "zh": "（等等……怎么回事？\n刚刚好像有什么声音……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "4062da28d875ff869e01e13c2a709afcfbb22ca792ab978765411b5b083c2918", "ja": "？　おやぶん、どうかした？", "zh": "嗯？老大，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "43fb82fa8e985e50c85716627a5531de00a873e855ca7ca6d19ed69507ff579c", "ja": "ふたりは……何ともなさそうだな。\nいや、なんでもない。多分、気のせいだろう。", "zh": "你们两个……好像都没感觉呢。\n不，没什么，大概是我多心了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "d29f1b5e27c25af63490ae9e87ed1b15cf00c97d564d90f365661693cad1d5cf", "ja": "それより、ふたりともやる気になってくれたことだし。\n早速レッスンを始めようか！", "zh": "先不说那个了，既然你们都干劲十足，\n我们就马上来开始训练课程吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "08a44ccf16cbc9319a5978d9d3d237692eff225899a32c46675b354077277d8d", "ja": "えーっ！？", "zh": "咦──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "5269c9788f8a9ee39e5ed5f35c93e4e6998ecad895398e929cf101221104bc83", "ja": "あ、あれ？\n真美、やる気になってなかったのか？", "zh": "欸，奇怪了？\n真美，你刚刚不是很有干劲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "d3c6dbaaa497c8945127c99f55bc0c1b1f8623d484e8ce0ee8f2b79745df5f87", "ja": "なってるよ～。なってるから真美は、\nたまきちともっと遊んで、こう……", "zh": "有啊～就是因为有，\n所以真美想跟阿环再多玩一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "efc18b4ead96d9581d9d19477959f2450472239f8ecef9ed5ea44517afed1d57", "ja": "おしんこを漬けたいの！", "zh": "好增加怡情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "8fa142751f542a9d3e11ac1e80027470a5b4cc9787a3a30055e633437215a8af", "ja": "（おしんこを……漬けたい……）", "zh": "（增加……怡情……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1036_p", "source_sha256": "65cc3b27f203963f1fe70a7af6f38e2900cc4e6c1420af582494b8ce18ed67d8", "ja": "親交を深めたい？", "zh": "增进情谊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1037_012mam", "source_sha256": "e5fd5419c037fc157a45dc938b3cb3e9904887559ec49f5feb8c6fcf1544644b", "ja": "そうそれ！\n友情パワーが勝利の秘訣なんだよ、兄ちゃん！", "zh": "对对对！\n这是友情力量胜利的秘诀喔，大哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "ec39012870043a17f0ac989f5762135dd0d7b5b4fb9ce77fd799e115718ffc34", "ja": "まあ、一理あるかもな……。\nよし、わかった。レッスンは明日からにしようか。", "zh": "唔，这话也是有道理……\n好，我知道了，那训练课程就明天再开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1039_012mam", "source_sha256": "6e1ebf8e1416c5affb178d0f95cbf0a983af80ae10509bb3f46e7e23261e16d5", "ja": "やったー！　さっすが兄ちゃん、話がわかるね！\nわかりやすい兄ちゃんだね♪", "zh": "太好了──！不愧是大哥哥，一点就通！\n大哥哥太好懂了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1040_012mam", "source_sha256": "6d605bcc4a1e182a6094531a5c05f11411c15a66e8518698052978f5469b199f", "ja": "んじゃたまきち、何して遊ぼっか？\n今度はたまきちが決める番だよ！", "zh": "那么阿环，我们要玩什么好？\n这次轮到阿环决定啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1041_040tam", "source_sha256": "a7c7757b998113c370fbcff42ea700b4fa747a77366124ed62e6d965bf7f1c24", "ja": "じゃあね～、んーっと、んーっと……。\nそうだ！　劇場の探検しよー！", "zh": "那就～环想想～想一下……\n对了！在剧场里探险吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1042_012mam", "source_sha256": "ba8c15d9204c4a9492347bbae05bc62929c15dfb5e9ff97a525032695b2724c9", "ja": "ほほーう、それはまたツウな遊びですなー。\n兄ちゃんのヒミツの小部屋を見つけちゃうかもですな！", "zh": "哦～这还真是内行人的游戏呢～\n搞不好还能找到大哥哥的秘密小房间喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "5feefd226a14891bef28ebf96c945c9f9d021d1a8b8c081a8a4b83a06bbc45c8", "ja": "いや、そんなものはないぞ？", "zh": "不不，根本没有那种地方啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1044_012mam", "source_sha256": "edf19f6dd545a13ca62972ca6ec0a456a91e0bf89ba9b66e2c62454a44385861", "ja": "はたしてそうかな～？　ま、いいや。\nんじゃ、まみたま探検隊、しゅっぱーつ♪", "zh": "真的是这样吗～？不过算了。\n那么，真美阿环探险队，出发～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1045_040tam", "source_sha256": "f8dcbd98e462bb5cfe701c12e72bfe34e82c9d08ac58008eb1d77f6a1417be6b", "ja": "おーっ♪\nおやぶんも来るよね？", "zh": "哦～♪\n老大也会一起来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1046_p", "source_sha256": "91bcbab9267edf8040df418494c729744ac5677726179611812598ff049710c8", "ja": "うーん、そうだな。危ないところに行かれても……\nよし、付き合うとするか！", "zh": "嗯──也对，要是你们跑到什么危险的地方……\n好，我就陪你们一起去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1047_p", "source_sha256": "bc68de1d2cce74569b4d4c1e202bf8ce9b79bf344f67079cd9748e7d658f22c0", "ja": "それで、どこを探検するんだ？", "zh": "所以要到哪去探险呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1048_040tam", "source_sha256": "03825980573de21fc444405aaa3e6fce2f29c57ea27e461871aa699ec791fbbc", "ja": "まずは倉庫！　あそこ、\nいろんなものがあって、楽しいんだぞ♪", "zh": "首先是仓库！\n那里面有各种东西，很有趣喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1049_012mam", "source_sha256": "7fb9d232b100574ae5281c443c72c31cac373fce63387106fc2d72dd6e45331f", "ja": "ここだね！　ドアを開けるよ！\nまみたま探検隊の大冒険のはじまりはじまり～！", "zh": "就是这里吧！真美要开门啰！\n真美阿环探险队的大冒险开始啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "fac97866c21a27eb8383a2a0e9014d4bf32330d0d53a98efef2941e90f03bd3e", "ja": "（真美が倉庫のドアを開けると、そこは……）", "zh": "（真美一打开仓库的门，眼前……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1051_012mam", "source_sha256": "91142c69f73935d5576e87b11db4d8088359ff79f895252a5743001ecf93a34c", "ja": "あり？", "zh": "欸？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1052_040tam", "source_sha256": "9830328c9b0b6e8827c87d0ee526aeb8268e41a95ac437040aef741dc41747a2", "ja": "あれ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_01_1053_p", "source_sha256": "aa9ff4a92d22129218f34463aac1bbf1b6ed42d2e6c80df4be32e8bb762136d0", "ja": "（そこは、ジャングルだった……）", "zh": "（竟是一片丛林……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
